    </node>
    <node id="GE-FL">
      <data key="d0">GE-FL</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A machine learning method that learns from labeled features using generalized expectation criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A baseline method based on generalization expectation criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A method that involves labeled features and potentially regularization terms, serving as a baseline for comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;A Generalized Expectation (GE) method that leverages labeled features as prior knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;Generalized Expectation-Feature Learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-003</data>
      <data key="d4">qasper_1503.00841.md</data>
      <data key="d5">1785212123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Information Gain">
      <data key="d0">Information Gain</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A method used to calculate the mutual information of features according to document labels to select labeled features.&lt;SEP&gt;A method used to obtain labeled features by calculating the gain of information.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-003</data>
