    <node id="Equation 6">
      <data key="d0">Equation 6</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The objective function formula: $\mathcal {O} = \sum _{k \in K} KL(\hat{p}(y|x_k) || p_\theta (y | x_k)) + \sum _{y,i} \frac{\theta _{yi}^2}{2 \sigma ^2}$</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">qasper_1503.00841.md</data>
      <data key="d5">1785212123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Equation 9">
      <data key="d0">Equation 9</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The objective function formula including neutral features: $\mathcal {O}_{NE} = \mathcal {O} + \sum _{k \in K^{^{\prime }}} KL(\hat{p}_u(y|x_k) || p_\theta (y | x_k))$</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">qasper_1503.00841.md</data>
      <data key="d5">1785212123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Equation 11">
      <data key="d0">Equation 11</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The objective function formula including maximum entropy term: $\mathcal {O}_{ME} = \mathcal {O} + \lambda \sum _{y} p(y) \log p(y)$</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">qasper_1503.00841.md</data>
      <data key="d5">1785212123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
