    <node id="Druck et al.">
      <data key="d0">Druck et al.</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An entity that explored constraints of labeled features within the GE framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Proposed GE-FL to learn from labeled features using generalized expectation criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Explored constraints of labeled features in the framework of GE by forcing the model's predicted feature distribution to approach the reference distribution. Proposed an active learning method which solicits labels on features rather than on instances and then used GE-FL to train the model.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8883a5d4e790630b007c233701f21e64-chunk-003</data>
