    <edge source="Multilingual Model" target="CLV">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">For sampling CLVs, we need to consider three factors: two corresponding to probabilities of generating the aligned roles, and the third one corresponding to selecting the CLV according to CRP.&lt;SEP&gt;Hence, we use an approximation where we treat each of the aligned roles as being generated twice, once by the monolingual model and once by the corresponding CLV.&lt;SEP&gt;We treat each of the aligned roles as being generated twice, once by the corresponding CLV.&lt;SEP&gt;For sampling roles in the multilingual model, we consider probabilities from the CLVs.&lt;SEP&gt;A value for a CLV represents a correlation between labels predicted in two languages.&lt;SEP&gt;For sampling CLVs, we need to consider selecting the CLV according to CRP.&lt;SEP&gt;We generate the CLVs via a Chinese Restaurant Process BIBREF11.</data>
      <data key="d9">approximated by treating aligned roles as generated twice,considers probabilities from,generated by,generates,generates aligned roles,represents correlation in,selects according to CRP</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-8be4503c1206a1d3f8a4068a05c69328-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d11">qasper_1603.01514.md</data>
      <data key="d12">1785212169</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Multilingual Model" target="Chinese Restaurant Process (CRP)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">CLVs are generated via a Chinese Restaurant Process.</data>
      <data key="d9">generates</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-8be4503c1206a1d3f8a4068a05c69328-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d11">qasper_1603.01514.md</data>
      <data key="d12">1785212169</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Multilingual Model" target="Equation UID11">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The new joint probability can be written as equation UID11.</data>
      <data key="d9">represented by</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-8be4503c1206a1d3f8a4068a05c69328-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d11">qasper_1603.01514.md</data>
      <data key="d12">1785212169</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Multilingual Model" target="Figure FIGREF7">
